      {
        "q": "What are the key differences between the Miles & More World and Miles & More Select Axis Bank Credit Cards?",
        "a": "Miles & More World Axis Bank Credit Card is the base variant, offering 4 Award Miles per Rs. 200 spent, 16 domestic and 2 international lounge visits per year at an fee of Rs. 3,500. Whereas, Miles & More Select Card is the premium variant, offering 6 Award Miles per Rs. 200 spent, 32 domestic and 4 international lounge visits every year at a comparatively higher joining and annual fee of Rs. 10,000 and Rs. 4,500, respectively."
